**Remark 6.1 (What is not proved).** The volume proves the converse fails at length nine; failure at length eight was previously known (Remark 4.8). It proves nothing about any other length: neither the existence nor the non-existence of symmetry-free bad $\{\pm1\}$-potentials on $C_L$ for $L\notin\{8,9\}$, nor any minimality statement in $L$.

